# Web automated calendar

Chrome/web Firestore cache is often empty. Never load hearings with:

`get(Source.cache)` then `get().timeout(1 second)`

That returns empty and the court overlay vanishes. Use `FirestoreQueryGet.hearings()` (15s on web). Replay overlay rows on stream `onListen`. Staff calendar must call `_loadAutomatedHearings` + `_applyAutomatedHearingRows`.
